## Where this came from

This project began as a port of **ni5arga/iitk**, the same idea built for
IIT Kanpur: https://github.com/ni5arga/iitk — MIT licensed, © 2026 ni5arga.

Substantial portions of the source originate there and are used under the terms
above, which is why that copyright notice is reproduced alongside ours. The
parts carried over largely unchanged:

  src/route/router.ts     A* over the path network, the CSR adjacency, the heap
  src/search/hours.ts     the partial `opening_hours` reader
  src/search/engine.ts    the fuzzy scoring and the document/index model
  src/map/style.ts        the MapLibre style and both colour palettes
  src/styles.css          the design tokens and most of the layout
  scripts/build-data.mjs  the Overpass -> GeoJSON + routing-graph pipeline
  scripts/smoke.mjs       the test harness shape

What is new here: the aerial imagery layer, the surveying tool the places were
collected with, boundary-derived map framing, the `places.fromOsm` switch, and
the categories and classifier rules this campus needed.

---

## Everything that is not source code

This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

Map data in `data/raw/` and everything derived from it is © OpenStreetMap
contributors, licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL):
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

Surveyed places in `data/curated/places.json` were collected on foot for this
project and are released under the same ODbL terms, so they can be folded back
into OpenStreetMap without a licensing problem.

Aerial imagery is served live from Esri World Imagery and is not redistributed
by this repository. It remains © Esri, Maxar, Earthstar Geographics and their
suppliers: https://www.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=10df2279f9684e4a9f6a7f08febac2a9

Label glyphs in `public/font/` are derived from Noto Sans, licensed under the
SIL Open Font License 1.1: https://openfontlicense.org
